# Manny's Garage takes no secrets.
#
# Booking and payment run on the shop's own accounts, off-site:
#   Automotive        -> ARI    (portal.ari.app)
#   Handyman, DIY Bay -> Square (book.squareup.com)
#   I.T.              -> a phone call; tech jobs are priced after we look
#
# Both are plain outbound links from /book and /quote, so there is no API key,
# no webhook and no database. The URLs live in src/lib/fixed-quote-options.ts
# as ARI_AUTOMOTIVE_BOOKING_URL and SQUARE_BOOKING_URL — change them there.
#
# This file previously listed Supabase and Twilio credentials for a /book form
# that stored bookings itself. That form is gone: on Vercel it had nowhere to
# write, so it silently dropped every submission while telling the customer it
# had been received. Nothing replaced it because nothing needed to — the shop
# already ran two real booking systems.
